UR  - https://search.library.ualberta.ca/openurl/01UOA_INST/01UOA_INST:UOA?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:&id=doi:&issn=&isbn=&volume=&issue=&spage=&pages=&date=2025&title=clinicaltrials.gov&atitle=Sedation+of+Remazolam+in+Combination+With+Afentanil+in+Non-intubated+Thoracoscopic+Pulmonary+Surgery%3A+a+Single-blind%2C+Randomized%2C+Controlled+Trial&aulast=&pid=%3Cauthor%3Eanonymous%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3ENCT06810843%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EClinical+Trial%3C%2FDT%3E
