UR  - https://search.library.ualberta.ca/openurl/01UOA_INST/01UOA_INST:UOA?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:&id=doi:&issn=&isbn=&volume=&issue=&spage=&pages=&date=2024&title=clinicaltrials.gov&atitle=The+Incidence+of+Post-Operative+Lung+Atelectasis+With+Erector+Spinae+Plane+Block+in+Bariatric+Surgery%3A+A+Prospective+Randomized+Controlled+Trial&aulast=&pid=%3Cauthor%3Eanonymous%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3ENCT06695858%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EClinical+Trial%3C%2FDT%3E
