UR  - https://search.library.ualberta.ca/openurl/01UOA_INST/01UOA_INST:UOA?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:&id=doi:&issn=&isbn=&volume=&issue=&spage=&pages=&date=2012&title=clinicaltrials.gov&atitle=Propofol+Versus+Midazolam+for+Sedation+in+Mechanically+Ventilated+Critically+Ill+Patients+Who+Presented+With+Traumatic+Brain+Injury%3A+Cytokine+Response+and+Neuropsychological+Assessment+%28IRRC%231201M%29&aulast=&pid=%3Cauthor%3Eanonymous%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3ENCT01712477%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EClinical+Trial%3C%2FDT%3E
