UR  - https://search.library.ualberta.ca/openurl/01UOA_INST/01UOA_INST:UOA?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:&id=doi:&issn=&isbn=&volume=&issue=&spage=&pages=&date=2025&title=clinicaltrials.gov&atitle=The+Impact+of+Multimodal+Balancing+Anesthesia+vs+Opioid+Free+Anesthesia+on+Postoperative+Pain+Intensity+and+Stress+Response+After+Open+Gynecology+Surgery&aulast=&pid=%3Cauthor%3Eanonymous%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3ENCT07138053%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EClinical+Trial%3C%2FDT%3E
