UR  - https://search.library.ualberta.ca/openurl/01UOA_INST/01UOA_INST:UOA?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:&id=doi:&issn=&isbn=&volume=&issue=&spage=&pages=&date=2025&title=clinicaltrials.gov&atitle=Effect+of+Early+Versus+Late+Aminophylline+Administration+on+Recovery+Profile+in+Pediatric+Patients+Undergoing+Ambulatory+Surgery+Under+General+Anesthesia%3B+a+Randomised+Controlled+Trial&aulast=&pid=%3Cauthor%3Eanonymous%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3ENCT07011134%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EClinical+Trial%3C%2FDT%3E
