UR  - https://search.library.ualberta.ca/openurl/01UOA_INST/01UOA_INST:UOA?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:&id=doi:&issn=&isbn=&volume=&issue=&spage=&pages=&date=2024&title=clinicaltrials.gov&atitle=A+Multicenter+Clinical+Study+of+Ultra-Fast-Track+Cardiac+Anesthesia+in+Minimally+Invasive+Cardiac+Surgery+for+Valvular+Heart+Disease&aulast=&pid=%3Cauthor%3Eanonymous%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3ENCT06541483%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EClinical+Trial%3C%2FDT%3E
