UR  - https://search.library.ualberta.ca/openurl/01UOA_INST/01UOA_INST:UOA?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:&id=doi:&issn=&isbn=&volume=&issue=&spage=&pages=&date=2024&title=clinicaltrials.gov&atitle=High-flow+Nasal+Cannula+%28HFNC%29+Oxygen+Therapy+Versus+Conventional+Nasal+Oxygen+Therapy+%28COT%29+in+Prolonged+Upper+Gastrointestinal+%28UGI%29+Endoscopy+Inside+the+Intensive+Care+Unit+%28ICU%29%3A+a+Prospective%2C+Randomized%2C+Controlled+Clinical+Study&aulast=&pid=%3Cauthor%3Eanonymous%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3ENCT06350864%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EClinical+Trial%3C%2FDT%3E
