UR  - https://search.library.ualberta.ca/openurl/01UOA_INST/01UOA_INST:UOA?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:&id=doi:&issn=&isbn=&volume=&issue=&spage=&pages=&date=2023&title=clinicaltrials.gov&atitle=The+Use+of+Lung+Ultrasound%2C+Fluoroscopy+and+Auscultation+to+Confirm+Proper+Positioning+of+Left+Sided+Double+Lumen+Tube%3A+A+Comparative+Study&aulast=&pid=%3Cauthor%3Eanonymous%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3ENCT06383156%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EClinical+Trial%3C%2FDT%3E
