UR  - https://search.library.ualberta.ca/openurl/01UOA_INST/01UOA_INST:UOA?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:&id=doi:&issn=&isbn=&volume=&issue=&spage=&pages=&date=2022&title=clinicaltrials.gov&atitle=Effect+of+Inhalational+Sedation+on+Mechanical+Power+in+Mechanically+Ventilated+Patients%3A+a+Pilot+Open-label+Randomized+Controlled+Study&aulast=&pid=%3Cauthor%3Eanonymous%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3ENCT05559970%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EClinical+Trial%3C%2FDT%3E
