UR  - https://search.library.ualberta.ca/openurl/01UOA_INST/01UOA_INST:UOA?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:&id=doi:&issn=&isbn=&volume=&issue=&spage=&pages=&date=2022&title=clinicaltrials.gov&atitle=Ultrasound-Guided+Single+Shoot+Serratus+Anterior+Plane+Block+Versus+Erector+Spinae+Plane+Block+as+Novel+Techniques+for+Post-Thoracotomy+Pain+Control+in+Pediatric+Cardiac+Surgery+and+Its+Effect+in+Ultra-Fast+Track+Recovery%3A+A+Prospective+Randomized+Trial&aulast=&pid=%3Cauthor%3Eanonymous%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3ENCT05526469%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EClinical+Trial%3C%2FDT%3E
