UR  - https://search.library.ualberta.ca/openurl/01UOA_INST/01UOA_INST:UOA?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:&id=doi:&issn=&isbn=&volume=&issue=&spage=&pages=&date=2022&title=clinicaltrials.gov&atitle=A+Randomized%2C+Double-Blind%2C+Placebo-Controlled+Study+to+Explore+Perioperative+Functional+Audio+for+Anxiety+and+Cognitive+Recovery+From+Propofol+Anaesthesia+in+Patients+Undergoing+Endoscopic+Procedures&aulast=&pid=%3Cauthor%3Eanonymous%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3ENCT05291832%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EClinical+Trial%3C%2FDT%3E
