UR  - https://search.library.ualberta.ca/openurl/01UOA_INST/01UOA_INST:UOA?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:&id=doi:&issn=&isbn=&volume=&issue=&spage=&pages=&date=2022&title=clinicaltrials.gov&atitle=The+Effects+of+Individualized+Lung-protective+Ventilation+With+Lung+Dynamic+Compliance-guided+Positive+End-expiratory+Pressure%28PEEP%29+Titration+on+Postoperative+Pulmonary+Complications+of+Pediatric+Video-assisted+Thoracoscopic+Surgery&aulast=&pid=%3Cauthor%3Eanonymous%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3ENCT05386901%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EClinical+Trial%3C%2FDT%3E
