UR  - https://search.library.ualberta.ca/openurl/01UOA_INST/01UOA_INST:UOA?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:&id=doi:&issn=&isbn=&volume=&issue=&spage=&pages=&date=2022&title=clinicaltrials.gov&atitle=Study+Protocol%3A+The+Effect+of+Blood+Pressure+on+Cerebral+Blood+Flow+in+Comatose+Out-of-hospital+Cardiac+Arrest+Patients&aulast=&pid=%3Cauthor%3Eanonymous%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3ENCT05434910%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EClinical+Trial%3C%2FDT%3E
