UR  - https://search.library.ualberta.ca/openurl/01UOA_INST/01UOA_INST:UOA?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:&id=doi:&issn=&isbn=&volume=&issue=&spage=&pages=&date=2017&title=clinicaltrials.gov&atitle=Lidocaine+as+an+ETT+Cuff+Media+in+the+Immediate+Post-operative+Cardiac+Surgery+Patient+Population%2C+and+Its+Effect+on+Sedation%2FAnalgesia+Requirements%3A+a+Pilot+Study&aulast=&pid=%3Cauthor%3Eanonymous%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3ENCT03343080%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EClinical+Trial%3C%2FDT%3E
