UR  - https://search.library.ualberta.ca/openurl/01UOA_INST/01UOA_INST:UOA?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:&id=doi:&issn=&isbn=&volume=&issue=&spage=&pages=&date=2010&title=clinicaltrials.gov&atitle=Comparative+Study+of+the+Non-dependent+Continuous+Positive+Pressure+Ventilation+and+High+Frequency+Positive+Pressure+Ventilation+During+One-lung+Ventilation+for+Thoracoscopy&aulast=&pid=%3Cauthor%3Eanonymous%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3ENCT01254786%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EClinical+Trial%3C%2FDT%3E
