UR  - https://search.library.ualberta.ca/openurl/01UOA_INST/01UOA_INST:UOA?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:&id=doi:&issn=&isbn=&volume=&issue=&spage=&pages=&date=2023&title=clinicaltrials.gov&atitle=Laryngoscopy+for+Neonatal+and+Infant+Airway+Management+with+Supplemental+Oxygen+At+Different+Flow+Rates+%28OPTIMISE-2%29%3A+a+Multi-center%2C+Non-inferiority%2C+Prospective+Randomized+Controlled+Trial&aulast=&pid=%3Cauthor%3Eanonymous%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3ENCT05967507%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EClinical+Trial%3C%2FDT%3E
