UR  - https://search.library.ualberta.ca/openurl/01UOA_INST/01UOA_INST:UOA?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:&id=doi:&issn=&isbn=&volume=&issue=&spage=&pages=&date=2017&title=clinicaltrials.gov&atitle=Comparison+of+Total+Intravenous+Anesthesia+vs.+Inhalational+Anesthesia+on+Brain+Relaxation%2C+Subdural+Pressure+and+Hemodynamics+in+Patients+With+Acute+Subdural+Hematoma+Undergoing+Emergency+Craniotomy-+A+Randomized+Control+Trial&aulast=&pid=%3Cauthor%3Eanonymous%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3ENCT03146104%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EClinical+Trial%3C%2FDT%3E
