UR  - https://search.library.ualberta.ca/openurl/01UOA_INST/01UOA_INST:UOA?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:&id=doi:&issn=&isbn=&volume=&issue=&spage=&pages=&date=2014&title=clinicaltrials.gov&atitle=Sugammadex+Compared+With+Neostigmin%2FAtropin+for+Neuromuscular+Block+Reversal+in+Patients+With+Obstructive+Sleep+Apnea&aulast=&pid=%3Cauthor%3Eanonymous%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3ENCT02160223%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EClinical+Trial%3C%2FDT%3E
