UR  - https://search.library.ualberta.ca/openurl/01UOA_INST/01UOA_INST:UOA?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:&id=doi:&issn=&isbn=&volume=&issue=&spage=&pages=&date=2021&title=clinicaltrials.gov&atitle=To+Evaluate+the+Safety+and+Efficacy+of+Preemptive+Administration+of+Continuous+Renal+Replacement+Therapy+in+Patients+With+Acute+Liver+Failure+With+Cerebral+Edema+-A+Prospective+Randomized+Controlled+Trial&aulast=&pid=%3Cauthor%3Eanonymous%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3ENCT04991259%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EClinical+Trial%3C%2FDT%3E
