UR  - https://search.library.ualberta.ca/openurl/01UOA_INST/01UOA_INST:UOA?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:&id=doi:&issn=&isbn=&volume=&issue=&spage=&pages=&date=2020&title=clinicaltrials.gov&atitle=Sevoflurane+for+Sedation+in+Acute+Respiratory+Distress+Syndrome%3A+a+Multicenter+Prospective+Randomized+Trial&aulast=&pid=%3Cauthor%3Eanonymous%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3ENCT04235608%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EClinical+Trial%3C%2FDT%3E
