UR  - https://search.library.ualberta.ca/openurl/01UOA_INST/01UOA_INST:UOA?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:&id=doi:&issn=&isbn=&volume=&issue=&spage=&pages=&date=2009&title=clinicaltrials.gov&atitle=A+Double-blinded+Randomized+Controlled+Trial+of+Dexmedetomidine+Versus+Propofol+for+Sedation+in+Mechanically+Ventilated+Medical+Intensive+Care+Unit+Patients&aulast=&pid=%3Cauthor%3Eanonymous%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3ENCT01059929%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EClinical+Trial%3C%2FDT%3E
