UR  - https://search.library.ualberta.ca/openurl/01UOA_INST/01UOA_INST:UOA?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:&id=doi:&issn=&isbn=&volume=&issue=&spage=&pages=&date=2009&title=clinicaltrials.gov&atitle=The+Effect+of+Etomidate+on+Outcomes+of+Trauma+Patients&aulast=&pid=%3Cauthor%3Eanonymous%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3ENCT00938990%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EClinical+Trial%3C%2FDT%3E
