UR  - https://search.library.ualberta.ca/openurl/01UOA_INST/01UOA_INST:UOA?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:&id=doi:&issn=&isbn=&volume=&issue=&spage=&pages=&date=2021&title=clinicaltrials.gov&atitle=Clinical+Performance+of+the+I-gel+and+the+Laryngeal+Tube+Suction+Disposable+Supraglottic+Airway+Devices+by+Novice+Intubators+During+Manual+In-line+Neck+Stabilization%3A+A+Randomized+Controlled+Trial&aulast=&pid=%3Cauthor%3Eanonymous%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3ENCT04909944%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EClinical+Trial%3C%2FDT%3E
