UR  - https://search.library.ualberta.ca/openurl/01UOA_INST/01UOA_INST:UOA?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:&id=doi:&issn=&isbn=&volume=&issue=&spage=&pages=&date=2017&title=clinicaltrials.gov&atitle=Single+Minute+of+Positive+End+Expiratory+Pressure+at+the+Time+of+Induction%3A+Effect+on+Arterial+Blood+Gases+and+Hemodynamics+in+Morbidly+Obese+Patients+Undergoing+Laparoscopic+Bariatric+Surgery&aulast=&pid=%3Cauthor%3Eanonymous%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3ENCT03024658%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EClinical+Trial%3C%2FDT%3E
