UR  - https://search.library.ualberta.ca/openurl/01UOA_INST/01UOA_INST:UOA?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:&id=doi:&issn=&isbn=&volume=&issue=&spage=&pages=&date=2016&title=clinicaltrials.gov&atitle=Comparison+of+Mannitol+Alone+Versus+Different+Doses+of+Mannitol+in+Combination+With+Furosemide+on+Brain+Relaxation+in+Supratentorial+Mass+Resection+Surgery&aulast=&pid=%3Cauthor%3Eanonymous%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3ENCT02712476%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EClinical+Trial%3C%2FDT%3E
