UR  - https://search.library.ualberta.ca/openurl/01UOA_INST/01UOA_INST:UOA?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:&id=doi:&issn=&isbn=&volume=&issue=&spage=&pages=&date=2016&title=clinicaltrials.gov&atitle=Comparison+of+Large+Antecubital+Vein+Versus+Small+Vein+on+Dorsum+of+Hand+for+the+Prevention+of+Propofol+Injection+Pain&aulast=&pid=%3Cauthor%3Eanonymous%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3ENCT04673500%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EClinical+Trial%3C%2FDT%3E
