UR  - https://search.library.ualberta.ca/openurl/01UOA_INST/01UOA_INST:UOA?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:&id=doi:&issn=&isbn=&volume=&issue=&spage=&pages=&date=2008&title=clinicaltrials.gov&atitle=Phase+I+Trial+to+Determine+Steady+State+Pharmacokinetics+and+Sedative+Effects+of+Low+Dose+Ketamine+Infusion&aulast=&pid=%3Cauthor%3Eanonymous%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3ENCT00618397%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EClinical+Trial%3C%2FDT%3E
