UR  - https://search.library.ualberta.ca/openurl/01UOA_INST/01UOA_INST:UOA?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:&id=doi:&issn=&isbn=&volume=&issue=&spage=&pages=&date=2024&title=clinicaltrials.gov&atitle=A+Randomized%2C+Double-blind+Study+to+Compare+the+Efficacy+of+Intravenous+Dexmedetomidine+Infusion%2C+Oral+Gabapentin+and+Their+Combination+on+Postoperative+Analgesia+in+Cancer+Patients+Undergoing+Modified+Radical+Mastectomy&aulast=&pid=%3Cauthor%3Eanonymous%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3ENCT06354478%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EClinical+Trial%3C%2FDT%3E
