UR  - https://search.library.ualberta.ca/openurl/01UOA_INST/01UOA_INST:UOA?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:&id=doi:&issn=&isbn=&volume=&issue=&spage=&pages=&date=2020&title=clinicaltrials.gov&atitle=Combined+Erector+Muscle+Spinae+Plane+Block+and+General+Anaesthesia+Versus+General+Anaesthesia+Alone+-+Effect+on+Perioperative+Opioid+Consumption+in+Open+Heart+Surgery&aulast=&pid=%3Cauthor%3Eanonymous%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3ENCT04338984%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EClinical+Trial%3C%2FDT%3E
