UR  - https://search.library.ualberta.ca/openurl/01UOA_INST/01UOA_INST:UOA?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:&id=doi:&issn=&isbn=&volume=&issue=&spage=&pages=&date=2018&title=clinicaltrials.gov&atitle=Evaluation+of+Postoperative+Analgesic+Effects+of+Bilateral+Suprazygomatic+Maxillary+Nerve+Block+Using+Bupivacaine+and+Dexmedetomidine+in+Children+Undergoing+Cleft+Palate+Repair+Under+General+Anesthesia%3ARandomized+Controlled+Trial&aulast=&pid=%3Cauthor%3Eanonymous%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3ENCT03412474%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EClinical+Trial%3C%2FDT%3E
