UR  - https://search.library.ualberta.ca/openurl/01UOA_INST/01UOA_INST:UOA?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:&id=doi:&issn=&isbn=&volume=&issue=&spage=&pages=&date=2024&title=clinicaltrials.gov&atitle=Effect+of+Preoperative+Stroke+Volume+Optimization+Using+Transthoracic+Echocardiography+on+Arterial+Hypotension+Following+Induction+of+Intravenous+Anesthesia.+A+Prospective%2C+Double+Blinded+Randomized+Study&aulast=&pid=%3Cauthor%3Eanonymous%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3ENCT06639737%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EClinical+Trial%3C%2FDT%3E
