UR  - https://search.library.ualberta.ca/openurl/01UOA_INST/01UOA_INST:UOA?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:&id=doi:&issn=&isbn=&volume=&issue=&spage=&pages=&date=2019&title=clinicaltrials.gov&atitle=Efficacy+of+Ultrasound-guided+Bilateral+Transversus+Thoracic+Muscle+Plane+Block+as+Postoperative+Analgesia+in+Adult+Patients+Undergoing+Open+Heart+Surgeries%3A+a+Randomized+Controlled+Study&aulast=&pid=%3Cauthor%3Eanonymous%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3ENCT04116554%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EClinical+Trial%3C%2FDT%3E
