UR  - https://search.library.ualberta.ca/openurl/01UOA_INST/01UOA_INST:UOA?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:&id=doi:&issn=&isbn=&volume=&issue=&spage=&pages=&date=2017&title=clinicaltrials.gov&atitle=The+Effect+of+Combined+General-epidural+vs+General+Anaesthesia+on+Postoperative+Intestinal+Function+Recovery+and+Infection+in+Neonates+and+Infants+Undergoing+Gastrointestinal+Surgery%3A+a+Prospective%2C+Randomised%2C+Controlled+Trial&aulast=&pid=%3Cauthor%3Eanonymous%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3ENCT03056261%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EClinical+Trial%3C%2FDT%3E
