UR  - https://search.library.ualberta.ca/openurl/01UOA_INST/01UOA_INST:UOA?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:&id=doi:&issn=&isbn=&volume=&issue=&spage=&pages=&date=2023&title=clinicaltrials.gov&atitle=The+Influence+of+Electroacupuncture+on+Postoperative+Agitation+of+Sevoflurane+Inhalation+Combined+With+Intravenous+Anesthesia+in+Pediatrics%3A+an+Experimental%2C+Single-center+Clinical+Study&aulast=&pid=%3Cauthor%3Eanonymous%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3ENCT05924854%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EClinical+Trial%3C%2FDT%3E
