UR  - https://search.library.ualberta.ca/openurl/01UOA_INST/01UOA_INST:UOA?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:&id=doi:&issn=&isbn=&volume=&issue=&spage=&pages=&date=2021&title=clinicaltrials.gov&atitle=A+Randomized+Pilot+Clinical+Trial+of+the+Effects+in+Oxygenation+and+Hypoxic+Pulmonary+Vasoconstriction+of+Sevoflurane+in+Patient%27s+Whit+ARDS+Secondary+to+Severe+Acute+Respiratory+Syndrome+Coronavirus+2+%28SARS-CoV2%29&aulast=&pid=%3Cauthor%3Eanonymous%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3ENCT04998253%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EClinical+Trial%3C%2FDT%3E
