UR  - https://search.library.ualberta.ca/openurl/01UOA_INST/01UOA_INST:UOA?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:&id=doi:&issn=&isbn=&volume=&issue=&spage=&pages=&date=2024&title=clinicaltrials.gov&atitle=Efficacy+and+Safety+of+Non-sedation+Trial+in+Patients+After+Neurosurgical+Craniotomy%3A+a+Single-arm%2C+Single-centre+Prospective+Study&aulast=&pid=%3Cauthor%3Eanonymous%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3ENCT06727435%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EClinical+Trial%3C%2FDT%3E
