UR  - https://search.library.ualberta.ca/openurl/01UOA_INST/01UOA_INST:UOA?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:&id=doi:&issn=&isbn=&volume=&issue=&spage=&pages=&date=2008&title=clinicaltrials.gov&atitle=Clinical+Trial+of+Euglycemia+Maintenance+With+Supraphysiologic+Insulin+vs+Conventional+Intensive+Insulin+Therapy+to+Improve+Outcomes+%28Neurologic%2C+Neuropsychiatric%2C+and+Biomarkers%29+After+Surgical+Treatment+of+Unruptured+Cerebral+Aneurysms&aulast=&pid=%3Cauthor%3Eanonymous%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3ENCT00615381%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EClinical+Trial%3C%2FDT%3E
