UR  - https://search.library.ualberta.ca/openurl/01UOA_INST/01UOA_INST:UOA?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:&id=doi:&issn=&isbn=&volume=&issue=&spage=&pages=&date=2007&title=clinicaltrials.gov&atitle=Randomized%2C+Placebo-Controlled%2C+Double-Blind+Clinical+Trial+to+Evaluate+the+Safety+and+Efficacy+of+Low-Dose+Glucocorticoid+Infusion+in+Acute+Respiratory+Distress+Syndrome+%28ARDS%29&aulast=&pid=%3Cauthor%3Eanonymous%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3ENCT00562835%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EClinical+Trial%3C%2FDT%3E
