UR  - https://search.library.ualberta.ca/openurl/01UOA_INST/01UOA_INST:UOA?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:&id=doi:&issn=&isbn=&volume=&issue=&spage=&pages=&date=2015&title=clinicaltrials.gov&atitle=The+Effect+of+BIS+Monitorization+to+Intraoperative+Anesthetic+and+Analgesic+Consumption+During+Coronary+Artery+Grafting+Surgery+and+Postoperative+Mortality+and+Morbidity&aulast=&pid=%3Cauthor%3Eanonymous%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3ENCT02520947%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EClinical+Trial%3C%2FDT%3E
