UR  - https://search.library.ualberta.ca/openurl/01UOA_INST/01UOA_INST:UOA?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:&id=doi:10.4103%2Fsja.sja_662_24&issn=1658-354X&isbn=&volume=19&issue=3&spage=327&pages=327-333&date=2025&title=Saudi+Journal+of+Anaesthesia&atitle=Erector+spinae+plane+block+complementary+analgesic+to+enhance+recovery+after+cardiac+surgery%3A+A+prospective+double-blinded+randomized+controlled+trial&aulast=Zabani&pid=%3Cauthor%3EZabani+I.A.%2CAlamoudi+D.%2CAlhroub+K.%2CAlhassoun+A.%2CTawfik+G.%2CAlzanbagi+A.%2CAlzahrani+F.%2CZia+F.%2CAlmuqati+R.%2CTayeb+A.%2CAlsayouri+Z.%2CSaad+H.%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3E2039167611%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EArticle%3C%2FDT%3E
