T1  - Ketorolac in the perioperative management of acute type A aortic dissection: a randomized double-blind placebo-controlled trial
A1  - Lv Z.-K.
A1  - Zhang H.-T.
A1  - Cai X.-J.
A1  - Su W.-X.
A1  - Zhu E.-J.
A1  - Chong H.
