UR  - https://search.library.ualberta.ca/openurl/01UOA_INST/01UOA_INST:UOA?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:&id=doi:10.1213%2F01.ane.0000803544.47940.c7&issn=0003-2999&isbn=&volume=132&issue=5+Supplement&spage=271&pages=271-272&date=2021&title=Anesthesia+and+Analgesia&atitle=Randomized+Controlled+Trial+of+the+Efficacy+and+Safety+of+Sugammadex+on+Time-to-Extubation+Following+Cardiac+Surgery&aulast=Bardia&pid=%3Cauthor%3EBardia+A.%2CTreggiari+M.%2CJohnson+C.%2CDai+F.%2CTickoo+M.%2CKunze+K.%2CTantawy+H.%2CGeirsson+A.%2CSchonberger+R.B.%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3E646609702%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EConference+Abstract%3C%2FDT%3E
