T1  - 369 Geriatric Emergency Department Guidelines 2.0: Systematic Review on the Comparative Safety of Sedating Medications Used in the Treatment of Older Adults With Acute Agitation
T3  - ACEP Research Forum. Philadelphia United States.
A1  - Casey M.
A1  - Elder N.
A1  - Fenn A.
A1  - Niznik J.
A1  - Khoujah D.
A1  - Ding M.
A1  - Goukasian N.
A1  - Koehl J.
A1  - Tyler K.
A1  - Liu S.
