UR  - https://search.library.ualberta.ca/openurl/01UOA_INST/01UOA_INST:UOA?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:&id=doi:10.4103%2Fija.ija_285_22&issn=0019-5049&isbn=&volume=66&issue=12&spage=849&pages=849-853&date=2022&title=Indian+Journal+of+Anaesthesia&atitle=Comparison+of+different+doses+of+atracurium+for+quality+of+muscle+relaxation+during+modified+rapid+sequence+induction+in+emergency+laparotomy%3A+A+prospective+randomised+double+blind+study&aulast=Holkunde&pid=%3Cauthor%3EHolkunde+R.%2CMasur+S.%2CPatil+B.A.%2CPatil+C.%2CNaik+D.%2CLamani+S.%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3E2022050110%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EArticle%3C%2FDT%3E
