UR  - https://search.library.ualberta.ca/openurl/01UOA_INST/01UOA_INST:UOA?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:27693070&id=doi:10.1016%2Fj.jemermed.2016.07.087&issn=0736-4679&isbn=&volume=51&issue=6&spage=752&pages=752-757&date=2016&title=Journal+of+Emergency+Medicine&atitle=Is+There+a+Role+for+Intravenous+Subdissociative-Dose+Ketamine+Administered+as+an+Adjunct+to+Opioids+or+as+a+Single+Agent+for+Acute+Pain+Management+in+the+Emergency+Department%3F&aulast=Motov&pid=%3Cauthor%3EMotov+S.%2CRosenbaum+S.%2CVilke+G.M.%2CNakajima+Y.%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3E613479033%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3ENote%3C%2FDT%3E
