UR  - https://search.library.ualberta.ca/openurl/01UOA_INST/01UOA_INST:UOA?sid=OVID:embase&id=pmid:18782697&id=doi:10.1532%2FHSF98.20081036&issn=1098-3511&isbn=&volume=11&issue=4&spage=185&pages=185-191&date=2008&title=Heart+Surgery+Forum&atitle=Use+of+high-thoracic+epidural+analgesia+in+pulmonary+endarterectomy%3A+A+randomized+feasibility+study&aulast=Kunstyr&pid=%3Cauthor%3EKunstyr+J.%2CKlein+A.%2CLindner+J.%2CRubes+D.%2CBlaha+J.%2CJansa+P.%2CLips+M.%2CAmbroz+D.%2CStritesky+M.%3C%2Fauthor%3E%3CAN%3E352341323%3C%2FAN%3E%3CDT%3EArticle%3C%2FDT%3E
